[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21903.51, "timestamp": "06:05:03", "text": "可以看到我的鼠標。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21924.39, "timestamp": "06:05:24", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21928.83, "timestamp": "06:05:28", "text": "所以，這些星座就像閃耀的星辰。  H. 還有這個，還有Zuchi，我的媽媽。猜猜看。這是一個星座。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21932.11, "timestamp": "06:05:32", "text": "其實是獅子座。"}]